{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingTauAnchorClosure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingTauAnchorClosure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingRecurrenceSpectral","lean:module:QOU.Mass.Lever1TauClosedForm"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.aD5_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.aD5_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L80-L98","doc":"**Closed form of the odd partner.**\n`a_D^(5) = (81q⁸ + 308q⁶ − 64q⁵ + 354q⁴ − 64q³ + 308q² + 81) / (48q³(q+1)²)` (`≈ 5.3556` at `q₀`).\n\nHonest scope: this is the depth-2 kernel's `n=5` *prediction* — exact through the seed `n ≤ 4`, but\nthe independently-computed selection-rule value `lw(4)` does **not** satisfy the recurrence (it\ndiffers by `≈ 0.4 %`; the windowed-kernel drift now Lean-proved at `q=1` in\n`QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2Exclusion`). So this is the kernel's value, **not** a claim that\n`a_D^(5) = lw(4)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.aD5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.aD5","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L76-L78","doc":"The depth-2 recurrence's `n=5` term — the bar-antisymmetric **odd partner**\n`a_D^(5) = τ·a_D^(4) − a_D^(3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.binding_extensive_at_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.binding_extensive_at_substrate","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L68-L74","doc":"**The binding kernel is extensive at the substrate.** Given the wired anchors, the dominant root\nof `R(q,x) = x² − τx + 1` exceeds `1` for every `q > 0` — the extensive (A-scaling) growth a\nsaturating multiplicative trace (`τ = 2`, `λ = 1`) cannot source. Composes `tauAnchor_gt_two` with\nthe abstract spectral bridge `lambdaPlus_gt_one`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.tauAnchor_gt_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.tauAnchor_gt_two","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L62-L66","doc":"**The wired trace exceeds `2` throughout the substrate regime.** For every `q > 0`, `2 < τ`.\nThe obstruction is the sum-of-squares positivity of the numerator `9q⁴ − 8q³ + 8q² − 8q + 9`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.tauAnchor_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.tauAnchor_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L55-L60","doc":"**Closed form of the wired trace** — `τ = 3(3q⁴ + 8q² + 3)/(4q(q+1)²)`. Cites\n`Lever1Tau.tau_kernel_closed_form` (no re-proof of the field identity). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.tauAnchor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.tauAnchor","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L51-L53","doc":"The binding-kernel trace from the `det = 1` depth-2 recurrence\n`a_D^(4) = τ·a_D^(3) − a_D^(2)` with `a_D^(2) = 1`: `τ = (1 + a_D^(4)) / a_D^(3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.aD4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.aD4","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L48-L49","doc":"`a_D^(4) = lw(3) = (3q² + 4 + 3q⁻²)/4` (proton / Family-A anchor, c = 3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.aD3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.aD3","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingTauAnchorClosure.lean#L45-L46","doc":"`a_D^(3) = lw(2) = (q+1)²/(3q)` (Hopf-link anchor, c = 2). ","signatureChunk":0}]}